## Why This Is Asked
This probes practical Azure Policy usage, Private Endpoints, tagging discipline, and CI/CD gating with rollback in a beginner-friendly way.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Policy deny public network access for storage accounts
- Private Endpoints and private DNS configuration
- Resource tagging as policy gates in CI/CD
- Rollback to last known-good ARM/Bicep template
- Monitoring and alerting via Azure Monitor

## Code Example
```json
{
  "properties": {
    "displayName": "Deny public network access on storage accounts",
    "policyType": "Regular",
    "mode": "All",
    "policyRule": {
      "if": {
        "allOf": [
          {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"},
          {"field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/networkAcls/defaultAction", "equals": "Allow"}
        ]
      },
      "then": {"effect": "Deny"}
    }
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you adapt this for multi-region storage and cross-tenant sharing?
- How would you test the CI gate to minimize false positives and ensure rollback works?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical use of CMK with storage in Azure and policy-driven governance across subscriptions; includes rollout, rollback, and testing.

## Key Concepts
- CMK in Azure Key Vault
- Azure Policy with DeployIfNotExists/AuditIfNotExists
- Key rotation, backups, and compliance reporting
- Per-subscription scoping and rollout testing

## Code Example
```json
{
  "policyName": "StorageAccounts-CMKBackedEncryption",
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "allOf": [
        {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"},
        {"field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/encryption.keySource", "notEquals": "Microsoft.KeyVault"}
      ]
    },
    "then": {"effect": "deny"}
  },
  "parameters": {
    "keyVault": {"type": "String"}
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle existing storage accounts that already use platform-managed keys?
- What monitoring/auditing would you add to ensure ongoing CMK compliance?
